 transcript variants, all encoding the same protein, have been identified. [provided by RefSeq, Sep 2011].","ncbi_source":"NCBI Gene summary (RefSeq), via MyGene.info","uniprot_function":[{"accession":"P50583","text":"Catalyzes the asymmetric hydrolysis of diadenosine 5',5'''-P1,P4-tetraphosphate (Ap4A) to yield AMP and ATP (By similarity). Exhibits decapping activity towards FAD-capped RNAs and dpCoA-capped RNAs in vitro (By similarity)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_03","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}